                <note rend="inline" type="source">711.60p2/30: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Minister in Latvia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Coleman</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1928-03-13T18:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">March 13,
                                1928—6 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>17. You are authorized to accept the two proposals in your 24, March 8, 5
                    p.m.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Kellogg</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
